{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Vanakan is a story about a priest in\u00a0the 500s Armenia who is on a spiritual journey, seeking to get closer to Jesus Christ through immersing deeper into His path and His teaching.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The priest travels through the country, visits old monasteries to pick the right one for his goal, meets different people and enjoys the locations he is at.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Vanakan is a text based adventure. Its gameplay features viewing beautiful illustrations of locations which immerse you in the atmosphere, text descriptions of the events and choices in each location that affect the following story and gameplay. The features several endings.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3645180?t=1744266308","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645180/9d31979072432bad2377433c9c1646346b37852b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744266308","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645180/83c1ec09f7f6f555599840562c7d7fc1e6a57abe/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744266308","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645180/83c1ec09f7f6f555599840562c7d7fc1e6a57abe/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744266308","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Vanakan is a story about a priest in\u00a0the 500s Armenia who is on a spiritual journey, seeking to get closer to Jesus Christ through immersing deeper into His path and His teaching.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The priest travels through the country, visits old monasteries to pick the right one for his goal, meets different people and enjoys the locations he is at.</p><p class=\"bb_p